      "abolition_note": "CHGIS 1911 Yushusishizutusi polygon demarcating the historic Alike homeland around A'nye Maqen, Dawu (Maqin), and Gande; after the Alike clan migrated north across the Yellow River into Tongde and Xinghai, this domain became the heartland of the Upper Ngolok confederation, incorporated into PRC administration following the August 1952 Guoluo Working Group.",
